    ex:confidence 0.6 ;
    ex:docStartOffset 3786 ;
    ex:endOffset 537 ;
    ex:evidence "- ``Mutect2_Multi.gatk4_jar`` -- Location *within the docker file* of the GATK4 jar file. If you wish you to use a different jar file, such as one on your local filesystem or a google bucket, specify that location with ``Mutect2_Multi.gatk4_jar_override``. This parameter is ignored if ``Mutect2_Multi.gatk4_jar_override`` is specified." ;
    ex:method "rules" ;
    ex:model "spacy:en_core_web_md+rules" ;
